etm-powersync-plugins-modbus (1.15.2+etm17) trixie; urgency=medium

  * debian: the Modbus V2C plugin package is renamed powersync-plugin-modbus-v2c.

    The name powersync-plugin-v2c goes to the V2C plugin over the charger's
    local HTTP API (etm-powersync-plugins). The new package takes over the
    files of powersync-plugin-v2c (<< 1.15.2+etm17) through Replaces/Breaks;
    the plugin itself, its identifiers and the things already set up are
    unchanged.

