etm-powersync-plugins-modbus (1.15.2+etm8) trixie; urgency=medium

  * sunspec: ask the connection thing directly instead of resolving it by id.
    The battery presence gate went through isFroniusChild(), which looks the
    parent up in myThings(). During the initial setup the parent is not
    registered yet, the lookup answers false, the Fronius gate is bypassed and
    the phantom storage child is created after all. Caught in closed-loop
    testing, not by the unit suite, which covers the decision and not the
    wiring. See sunspec/DIVERGENCES.md D-7.

