etm-powersync-plugins-modbus (1.15.2+etm5) trixie; urgency=medium

  * abbterra: decode the serial-number and firmware register fields as BCD, as
    specified by the ABB Modbus spec §5.1 (e.g. 0x49 = week 49, 0x22 = 22 kW),
    instead of as plain binary. The binary reading made deviceInfoFromValues()
    reject every real charger whose BCD production-week byte exceeded 0x35
    (e.g. week 46 = 0x46 = 70 > 53), failing setup with "The device does not
    match the ABB Terra AC Modbus register map", and mis-decoded the 11 kW/22 kW
    rated-power codes. Manual TCP add of the charger now completes.

