etm-powersync-plugins-modbus (1.15.2+etm4) trixie; urgency=medium

  * abbterra: fix TCP manual setup never establishing the connection.
    setupTcpThing() wired all the connection signals but never called
    connectDevice(), so reachableChanged()/initializationFinished() never fired
    and the setup hung until timeout ("Thing setup failed"). Now the connection
    is started when the NetworkDeviceMonitor reports the device online.

