etm-powersync-plugins-modbus (1.15.2+etm3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * abbterra: disable TCP auto-discovery (createMethods = "user" only) for the
    Terra AC Charger (TCP) thing class. Discovery blind-scans the LAN and blows
    up nymead with a SIGSEGV as soon as any Modbus device answers :502 with an
    exception response — the crash is in the generated reachability handler and
    cannot be fixed from the discovery code alone (two attempts failed). For the
    Waveshare RS485-gateway use case discovery can't determine the slave id
    anyway; the charger must be added manually (address + port + slaveId). This
    unblocks adding the charger and stops the crash loop. The underlying
    generated-code crash is tracked separately.

