etm-powersync-plugins-modbus (1.15.2+etm2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * abbterra: fix nymead SIGSEGV during ABB Terra AC TCP discovery. On a
    reachability-check exception (e.g. any Modbus device on the LAN answering
    :502 with "illegal data address"), AbbTerraTcpDiscovery::cleanupConnection()
    tore the connection down synchronously from inside the connection's own
    QModbusReply "finished" handler, freeing the in-flight reply that the
    generated code still dereferences at abbterramodbustcpconnection.cpp:2062.
    The teardown is now deferred (Qt::QueuedConnection) and made idempotent.
  * abbterra: restore checkReachableRegister ("serialNumber"), required by the
    libnymea-modbus 1.15 connection-class generator.

